A '''Red Gift''' is a {{Rare}} [[Gift]] obtained from {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. A player can give this to another player, allowing both of them to receive rewards.

== Obtaining ==
=== Frozen Treasure ===
Within the {{Zone|Glacial Cave}}, players can mine [[Frozen Treasure]] to obtain '''Red Gifts'''.

=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}
Damaging a {{MobSprite|Reindrake}} also has a {{Green|10%}} chance to drop a '''Red Gift'''.

=== Minions ===
'''Red Gifts''' can be obtained from [[Minions]] with the {{Item|Krampus Helmet}} upgrade. This grants a {{Chance|0.0045%|1|22,222}} chance to generate one per action.

=== Chicken Race ===
One '''Red Gift''' can be obtained from completing the first stage of the [[Chicken Race]].

=== Season of Jerry ===
During the [[Season of Jerry]] event, players can earn '''Gifts''' in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}} of all kinds across waves for [[Defend Jerry's Workshop|defending]] the village.

== Usage ==
=== Gifts ===
A '''Red Gift''' can be given to another player to spawn a present in which that player can open, with both players receiving the item inside. Once opened, the item will drop on the ground and only the 2 players that opened and gifted the present will be able to pick up the items. '''Red Gifts''' also have a {{Green|50%}} chance to give the player {{North Stars|1-5}}.

{{Item|Snowman Mask}}, {{Item|White Gift Talisman}} [[Accessory]] line, {{Item|Snowfin Shard}} and the Professional Gifter perk from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} give more rewards from '''Gifts'''.
